config 5DOS_OS
    bool "5DOS Five-Dimensional Operating System"
    depends on PROC_FS
    depends on KPROBES
    help
      Enable the 5DOS kernel subsystem for five-dimensional entity
      monitoring, ontological state classification, and priority
      scheduling based on synergy coefficients (κ, σ).

      This module provides /proc/5dos/ interfaces for runtime diagnostics
      and can adjust process nice values according to 5D state.
